+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on which password hashing algorithm to use. A prior decision on this topic was recorded and subsequently revoked, and no replacement algorithm has been decided since; anyone implementing password hashing should raise the question and record a fresh decision rather than assume a default.
